OL,9,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,10,     FAt the Brook Meadow B&B, near
OL,11,     FMarket Harborough, interior
OL,12,     Fdesigner Claire prides herself on
OL,13,     Fher dazzling decor. Is it a hit
OL,14,     Fwith her guests?
OL,15,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,16,     FJames hosts the second visit of
OL,17,     Fthe week at The Apollo Inn, in
OL,18,     FBarlborough, Derbyshire. He thinks
OL,19,     Fhis poached eggs are the best in
OL,20,     Fthe business, but will his guests
OL,21,     Fegg-ree?
