OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers head to The Swan Inn,
OL,7,     Fin Herefordshire, run by best
OL,8,     Ffriends Luke and Heather. The
OL,9,     Fguests are wowed by how
OL,10,     Fsparklingly new everything is but
OL,11,     Fthe continental breakfast isn't a
OL,12,     Fhit.
OL,13,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FThe week's final visit is to White
OL,15,     FMark Glamping in Watlington,
OL,16,     FOxfordshire, where hosts Steph and
OL,17,     FMartin are certain the B&Bers will
OL,18,     Flove the great outdoors. Their
OL,19,     Fguests aren't so sure...
